  crossing identity (joint - sum) = -4.050e-12   (tolerance 1.0e-06)   VERIFIED
  rung 1  (F diag, Theta diag, Sigma free)   logL = -32.0762826178
  rung 2  (F free, Theta free, Sigma free)   logL = -12.9718924710

